      "type": "info",
      "text": "**Fill shortcuts** copy formulas or values into neighbouring cells instantly: `Ctrl+D` (Mac: `⌘D`) fills down, and `Ctrl+R` (Mac: `⌘R`) fills right. Select the cell you want to copy along with the empty cells next to it, then press the shortcut."
